= Data Translation =

SQL Relay offers features for parsing and translating queries, and translating result sets.

* [queryparsing.html#queryparsing Query Parsing]
* [querytranslation.html#querytranslation Query Translation]
* [bindvariabletranslation.html#bindvariabletranslation Bind Variable Translation]
* [resultsetheadertranslation.html#resultsetheadertranslation Result Set Header Translation]
* [resultsettranslation.html#resultsettranslation Result Set Translation]
* [resultsetrowtranslation.html#resultsetrowtranslation Result Set Row Translation]
* [resultsetrowblocktranslation.html#resultsetrowblocktranslation Result Set Row Block Translation]
* [errortranslation.html#errortranslation Error Translation]
* [moduledata.html#moduledata Module Data]

